                <p class="text-teal-100 text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-80">
                    AssetFlow is engineered for organizations that demand rigorous asset accountability and optimized resource allocation. We eliminate operational complexity by providing a unified, secure system to track and audit every operational resource across your entire organizational infrastructure.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-[#14B8A6] mb-3 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em]">Multi-Tenant Architecture</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#F0FDFA] leading-relaxed opacity-90">Ensure complete data isolation across multiple departments or organizations within a single secure environment.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-[#14B8A6] mb-3 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em]">Global Audit Logging</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#F0FDFA] leading-relaxed opacity-90">Maintain an immutable record of every action, ensuring total transparency and accountability across the lifecycle.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-[#14B8A6] mb-3 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em]">Maintenance Scheduling</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#F0FDFA] leading-relaxed opacity-90">Automate asset health tracking and proactively manage maintenance workflows to prevent operational downtime.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-[#14B8A6] mb-3 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em]">Inventory Precision</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-[#F0FDFA] leading-relaxed opacity-90">Achieve 100% accuracy in resource allocation with real-time tracking and comprehensive metadata management.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
