                <p class="text-[#6B7280] mt-2 max-w-sm">Our technical team is available to assist with enterprise deployment and system support.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
                <div>
                    <span class="block text-[10px] font-black text-[#0F766E] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Email Support</span>
                    <div class="text-xl font-bold text-[#111827]">hz.zaidi@outlook.com</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="block text-[10px] font-black text-[#0F766E] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Direct Line</span>
                    <div class="text-xl font-bold text-[#111827]">0312-2539317</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-[#111827] py-16 px-10 text-slate-500">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 border-b border-white/5 pb-12 mb-8">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">About AssetFlow</h5>
                    <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed max-w-md">
                        A specialized enterprise asset management solution designed for digital permanence and operational clarity. Providing organizations in Karachi and beyond with high-performance tracking infrastructure.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="md:text-right">
                    <h5 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">Location</h5>
                    <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
