                        Contact: 0312-2539317
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
                <span>© 2026 AssetFlow Enterprise</span>
                <span class="mt-4 md:mt-0 opacity-50">Enterprise Resource Planning & Lifecycle Management</span>
            </div>
